{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789055924000-cbde7e", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "固定资产标签要贴哪些信息？现在有的设备找不到台账。", "id": "974ec4f10a7a435eb02dc6386610f3c6", "created_at": "2026-09-10T15:58:44", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "f81fb75a27ea4fd5b578afa318683795", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-10T15:58:44", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "0a52af15913d4b5996e2e8d22ccd722b", "created_at": "2026-09-10T15:58:52", "finished_at": "2026-09-10T15:59:34"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**固定资产标签内容**：资产编号（与台账一致）/ 名称 / 启用日期 / 使用部门 / 管理责任人二维码（扫码跳转台账页）。\n存量设备先拍照+贴临时编号，补录台账后再换正式标签；以后新设备到货当天贴标再入账。", "id": "2ab420b873d2411d896fa6769a310d12", "created_at": "2026-09-10T15:58:52", "finished_at": "2026-09-10T15:59:34"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "a803c02858d14f9cbd2a0133964916b2", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-10T15:58:52", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-10T15:59:34", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "大概多久能落实？", "id": "7b2a9cc02b1f4206ab12dbd4286b20ee", "created_at": "2026-09-10T16:02:34", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "c48f5a0d3a4e40eb94e650540fa35354", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-10T16:02:34", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "400fdd7908f4427aa169c1194054afc2", "created_at": "2026-09-10T16:02:40", "finished_at": "2026-09-10T16:03:09"}, {"type": "text", "text": "常规一周内落地：先发通知周知规则，第二天配置系统或表格，周末前完成首轮核对。加急可压缩到 48 小时，需要部门配合当天响应。", "id": "59f1c08119c3478ebee8de5b84b37add", "cr